{# Widget "stations" — the posts, and who the pings actually put on them.

   ROSTERED AND MEASURED ARE TWO COLUMNS AND THE MODULE NEVER MERGES THEM.
   The gap between what was planned and what the device reported is the thing
   this card exists to show; one verdict in its place would throw it away.

   THE DENOMINATOR IS THE AREA'S. "of the area's N" admits that the other
   posts exist and are deliberately not this module's business.

   BOUNDED, like every dashboard card: the first few posts, then the door. #}
<div class="c">
    <span class="tab">Stations &amp; who is actually on<span class="src">&middot; {{ dash.posts|length }} of the area&rsquo;s {{ dash.figures.day.postsInTheArea }}</span></span>
    {% if dash.posts|length > rosterStationLimit %}
        <a class="more" href="{{ path(constant('Uhifadhi\\Roster\\Controller\\RosterController::BOARD_ROUTE'), {uuid: area.uuid}) }}">{{ rosterStationLimit }} of {{ dash.posts|length }} &middot; the day board &rarr;</a>
    {% endif %}

    {% for post in dash.posts|slice(0, rosterStationLimit) %}
        <div class="rset">
            <span class="lb"><b>{{ post.stationName }}</b><em>{{ post.state.label }}</em></span>
            <span class="ct">
                {% for person in post.rostered|slice(0, 3) %}
                    <span class="r-sh {{ person.isFlagged ? 'st-fail' : (person.isPresent ? 'st-ok' : 'st-warn') }}"><i></i>{{ person.personName }}</span>
                {% else %}
                    <span class="r-sh">nobody rostered</span>
                {% endfor %}
            </span>
            <span class="why">
                <span class="unit">rostered</span> {{ post.rostered|length }}
                <span class="unit">expected</span> {{ post.expected }}
                <span class="unit">verified</span> {{ post.verified }}
                <span class="unit">flagged</span> {{ post.flagged }}
                {% if post.silentFor is not null %}<span class="unit">silent</span> {{ post.silentFor }} min{% endif %}
            </span>
        </div>
    {% else %}
        <div class="rfrag"><b>No post is on the roster&rsquo;s books</b><em>a watch is given to a post deliberately, so none is assumed</em></div>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
